  pages:
  - screenshot: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 89e7a09192d11f945b3a39c294091b32, type: 3}
    title: Shelf Selection
    body: This is the shelf selection panel. From here you can choose what shelf
      you would like to build.
  - screenshot: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 46c1c47860397dc4ebf0d970dfa7ef64, type: 3}
    title: Shelf Attributes
    body: The tooltip contains three shelf attributes. Price for unit price of each
      product in this shelf, and maintenance for the shelve's each day cost once
      you build it.
  - screenshot: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9d76bc73216dace41b05c3c723048b5d, type: 3}
    title: Category Filter
    body: At left of the panel there are category tabs for the different categories
      of shelves that you can build.
  - screenshot: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cb8d2282317ef324f9f28c359042277e, type: 3}
    title: Move and Destroy button
    body: At top are two other actions - move and destroy - and the close button
      to close the shelf selection panel
